                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6459133a-2402-3cd8-b9ae-faa977dbf3ad",
                        "entry_id": "6db5c7a3-8e6b-38a0-a70b-bb67ab0d0d0e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спортсмен, занимающийся греблей на каноэ"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ec8d149-550e-4b32-b3de-c8a3615a556a",
                                "sense_id": "6459133a-2402-3cd8-b9ae-faa977dbf3ad",
                                "text": "В одиночке каноисту приходится выполнять при каждом гребке подруливание, чтобы лодка не отклонялась от прямого курса."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7eac0ffb-71fa-4582-960b-4cac61f6e31f",
                                "sense_id": "6459133a-2402-3cd8-b9ae-faa977dbf3ad",
                                "text": "«Золото» 13-кратного чемпиона мира, призёра двух предыдущих Олимпиад Максима Опалева, ― первое в истории Игр у российских каноистов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80491077-40ed-4ff1-9cc7-bfbe98e6334d",
                        "source_entry_id": "6db5c7a3-8e6b-38a0-a70b-bb67ab0d0d0e",
                        "source_sense_id": "6459133a-2402-3cd8-b9ae-faa977dbf3ad",
                        "target_lang_word": "canoeist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "canoeist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68797484-3046-36ad-8e99-3b13388da37d",
                                        "entry_id": "56e19fcd-adc6-3e9b-bdb8-62c0193841f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who travels by canoe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8ea4b74-5a41-4a67-8e9d-080a12ec28cd",
                                                "sense_id": "68797484-3046-36ad-8e99-3b13388da37d",
                                                "text": "Though Hambleden's parish register records the death, in 1753, of a bargeman 'Kill'd by accident, shooting ye lock', the turbulent waters of Mill End weir on the River Thames, about a mile from the village, still attract canoeists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fde35e45-3815-44f1-8870-253e956ad9ed",
                                                "sense_id": "68797484-3046-36ad-8e99-3b13388da37d",
                                                "text": "Those people who have a meaningful relation to that body of water — whether it be a fisherman, a canoeist, a zoologist, or a logger — must be able to speak for the values which the river represents . . ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b8d3feec-6389-4537-a0dd-6ea3e222bf88",
                        "source_entry_id": "6db5c7a3-8e6b-38a0-a70b-bb67ab0d0d0e",
                        "source_sense_id": "6459133a-2402-3cd8-b9ae-faa977dbf3ad",
                        "target_lang_word": "canoer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "canoer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1e98854-c3d9-3b1d-86b4-9827e21d969c",
                                        "entry_id": "154f8106-0b81-3ccf-aa9d-bed3a5fe2340",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who travels by canoe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "080c2207-a206-445e-a577-991a18760dce",
                                                "sense_id": "e1e98854-c3d9-3b1d-86b4-9827e21d969c",
                                                "text": "Plain as it may be, the walkway does give kayakers and canoers, who have long clamored for access to the creek, a safe, legal launching area for the first time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "44902b9c-eda8-49bf-a98b-d57970a5727b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6db5c7a3-8e6b-38a0-a70b-bb67ab0d0d0e",
                        "source_sense_id": "6459133a-2402-3cd8-b9ae-faa977dbf3ad",
